# All New Features Demo

# --- String Interpolation ---
A Text named name exists.
name is "Alice".
A Number named age exists.
age is 30.
Print "Hello, ${name}! You are ${age} years old".

# --- Environment Variables ---
A Text named home exists.
home is the environment variable "USERPROFILE".
Print "User home: " followed by home.

# --- String Builtins (via side-note calls) ---
A Text named shout exists.
shout is (Uppercase "hello world").
Print shout.

A Text named quiet exists.
quiet is (Lowercase "HELLO WORLD").
Print quiet.

# --- For-Range Loop ---
Print "Counting 1 to 5:".
For Every Number from 1 to 5
    Print _index.

# --- Pipe Shell ---
Run the shell command `echo hello` and pipe to `findstr hello`.

# --- Include ---
Include "examples/hello.prose".
